      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is detecting a user-space bug. The C version of the driver calls binder_user_error which will (by default) print an error message and optionally pause the driver to help debug the issue. While the pause part is rarely used, I think we should at least keep the error message around, and the helper function/macro that clearly distinguish this from a driver error.",
      "revId": "5ca8d53de74dbdfccb391e64d62cc22d7ad24649",
