      "writtenOn": "2024-06-21T09:00:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The C version of the driver does not touch requested_threads and requested_threads_started if BINDER_LOOPER_STATE_ENTERED is set. This should not affect a correct user-space client, but if you want to match the behavior of the C version this could be improved.",
